### LabFlow demo API — VS Code "REST Client" extension (humao.rest-client).
### Chạy app trước: cd backend && mvn spring-boot:run -Dspring-boot.run.profiles=h2
### Mật khẩu mọi tài khoản demo: Labflow123. Thời gian là UTC: 02:00Z = 09:00 giờ Việt Nam.
### Đổi @day thành một ngày thứ Ba trong 14 ngày tới.

@base = http://localhost:8080/api/v1
@day = 2026-10-13

### Ping (không cần đăng nhập)
GET {{base}}/ping

### ── AUTH ─────────────────────────────────────────────
### Đăng ký (BR-01: chỉ email @fpt.edu.vn / @fe.edu.vn). Link xác minh in ra log của app.
POST {{base}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "newbie@fpt.edu.vn", "password": "Newbie2026", "fullName": "New Bie" }

### Xác minh email (dán token từ log "Open this link to activate your account: ...token=XXX")
POST {{base}}/auth/verify-email
Content-Type: application/json

{ "token": "PASTE_TOKEN_FROM_LOG" }

### Đăng nhập — sinh viên
# @name loginStudent
POST {{base}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "student1@fpt.edu.vn", "password": "Labflow123" }

### Đăng nhập — quản lý lab
# @name loginManager
POST {{base}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "manager@fpt.edu.vn", "password": "Labflow123" }

### Đăng nhập — admin
# @name loginAdmin
POST {{base}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "admin@fpt.edu.vn", "password": "Labflow123" }

### Đăng nhập — lab staff
# @name loginStaff
POST {{base}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "staff@fpt.edu.vn", "password": "Labflow123" }

@student = {{loginStudent.response.body.data.accessToken}}
@manager = {{loginManager.response.body.data.accessToken}}
@admin = {{loginAdmin.response.body.data.accessToken}}
@staff = {{loginStaff.response.body.data.accessToken}}

### Sai mật khẩu (5 lần liên tiếp ⇒ khoá 15 phút, BR-02)
POST {{base}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "student2@fpt.edu.vn", "password": "wrong1234" }

### Làm mới token (xoay vòng: token cũ hết dùng được)
POST {{base}}/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{ "token": "{{loginStudent.response.body.data.refreshToken}}" }

### Đăng xuất (thu hồi refresh token)
POST {{base}}/auth/logout
Content-Type: application/json

{ "token": "{{loginStudent.response.body.data.refreshToken}}" }

### Đổi mật khẩu
POST {{base}}/auth/change-password
Authorization: Bearer {{student}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "currentPassword": "Labflow123", "newPassword": "Labflow456" }

### Quên mật khẩu (luôn trả cùng một thông báo; link in ra log)
POST {{base}}/auth/forgot-password
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "student2@fpt.edu.vn" }

### Đặt lại mật khẩu
POST {{base}}/auth/reset-password
Content-Type: application/json

{ "token": "PASTE_TOKEN_FROM_LOG", "newPassword": "Reset2026a" }

### ── PROFILE + USERS ──────────────────────────────────
GET {{base}}/me
Authorization: Bearer {{student}}

###
PUT {{base}}/me
Authorization: Bearer {{student}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "fullName": "Demo Student One", "phone": "0912345678", "avatarUrl": "https://example.com/a.png" }

### Danh sách user (ADMIN): search + filter + sort + paging
GET {{base}}/users?q=student&role=STUDENT&status=ACTIVE&page=0&size=10&sort=email,asc
Authorization: Bearer {{admin}}

### Tạo user (ADMIN)
POST {{base}}/users
Authorization: Bearer {{admin}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "tech01@fpt.edu.vn", "fullName": "Tech One", "password": "Tech2026x", "roles": ["STAFF"] }

### Sửa user (ADMIN)
PUT {{base}}/users/3
Authorization: Bearer {{admin}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "fullName": "Demo Lab Staff", "roles": ["STAFF", "LECTURER"] }

### Khoá / mở khoá user (ADMIN)
PATCH {{base}}/users/6/status
Authorization: Bearer {{admin}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "status": "LOCKED" }

### ── SETTINGS (BR values) ─────────────────────────────
GET {{base}}/settings
Authorization: Bearer {{admin}}

###
PUT {{base}}/settings/booking.max-advance-days
Authorization: Bearer {{admin}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "value": "14" }

### ── BUILDINGS + LABS ─────────────────────────────────
GET {{base}}/buildings
Authorization: Bearer {{student}}

###
POST {{base}}/buildings
Authorization: Bearer {{manager}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "code": "GA", "name": "Gamma" }

### Danh sách lab: search + filter + sort + paging
GET {{base}}/labs?q=lab&status=ACTIVE&minCapacity=20&page=0&size=10&sort=capacity,desc
Authorization: Bearer {{student}}

###
GET {{base}}/labs/1
Authorization: Bearer {{student}}

### Tạo lab (31 chỗ > 30 ⇒ requiresApproval = true, BR-06)
POST {{base}}/labs
Authorization: Bearer {{manager}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "buildingId": 1, "code": "AL-401", "name": "AI Lab", "floor": 4, "capacity": 31 }

### Sửa lab (gửi version đang thấy; sai version ⇒ CONCURRENT_UPDATE)
PUT {{base}}/labs/5
Authorization: Bearer {{manager}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "buildingId": 1, "code": "AL-401", "name": "AI Lab", "floor": 4, "capacity": 30, "version": 0 }

###
PATCH {{base}}/labs/4/status
Authorization: Bearer {{manager}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "status": "ACTIVE" }

### ── EQUIPMENT ────────────────────────────────────────
GET {{base}}/equipment-types
Authorization: Bearer {{student}}

###
GET {{base}}/equipment?labId=3&status=AVAILABLE&sort=serial
Authorization: Bearer {{staff}}

###
POST {{base}}/equipment
Authorization: Bearer {{manager}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "labId": 1, "typeId": 2, "serial": "MCU-ESP32-03", "name": "ESP32 DevKit #3", "requiresTraining": false, "requiresApproval": false }

###
PUT {{base}}/equipment/4
Authorization: Bearer {{manager}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "labId": 1, "typeId": 2, "serial": "MCU-ESP32-01", "name": "ESP32 DevKit #1 (rev B)", "requiresTraining": false, "requiresApproval": false }

### Đổi trạng thái (MAINTENANCE/RETIRED cần lý do)
PATCH {{base}}/equipment/1/status
Authorization: Bearer {{staff}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "status": "MAINTENANCE", "reason": "Probe broken" }

### Đổi trạng thái hàng loạt (tất cả hoặc không)
PATCH {{base}}/equipment/status
Authorization: Bearer {{staff}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "ids": [4, 5], "status": "MAINTENANCE", "reason": "Firmware update" }

### ── OPERATING CALENDAR ───────────────────────────────
GET {{base}}/labs/3/hours
Authorization: Bearer {{student}}

### Giờ mở cửa thứ Bảy (6) của lab 1
PUT {{base}}/operating-hours
Authorization: Bearer {{manager}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "labId": 1, "dayOfWeek": 6, "openTime": "08:00", "closeTime": "17:00", "closed": false }

###
POST {{base}}/blackouts
Authorization: Bearer {{manager}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "labId": 2, "startAt": "{{day}}T06:00:00Z", "endAt": "{{day}}T08:00:00Z", "reason": "Network maintenance" }

###
GET {{base}}/labs/2/blackouts
Authorization: Bearer {{student}}

### ── AVAILABILITY ─────────────────────────────────────
GET {{base}}/availability?from={{day}}T02:00:00Z&to={{day}}T04:00:00Z&capacity=20
Authorization: Bearer {{student}}

###
GET {{base}}/availability/equipment?from={{day}}T02:00:00Z&to={{day}}T04:00:00Z&typeId=1
Authorization: Bearer {{student}}

### ── RESERVATION (spike) ──────────────────────────────
### Gửi lại cùng Idempotency-Key ⇒ 200 + cùng đặt chỗ (không tạo cái thứ hai)
POST {{base}}/reservations
Authorization: Bearer {{student}}
Idempotency-Key: demo-key-0001
Content-Type: application/json

{ "labId": 1, "startAt": "{{day}}T02:00:00Z", "endAt": "{{day}}T04:00:00Z", "purpose": "IoT practice" }

### Trùng giờ ⇒ 409 RES_CONFLICT
POST {{base}}/reservations
Authorization: Bearer {{student}}
Idempotency-Key: demo-key-0002
Content-Type: application/json

{ "labId": 1, "startAt": "{{day}}T03:00:00Z", "endAt": "{{day}}T05:00:00Z", "purpose": "IoT practice" }

###
GET {{base}}/reservations/mine
Authorization: Bearer {{student}}
